<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards" data-stagger><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/appraisal-clause-appraiser/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">01</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span class="card-p">Named as your party appraiser once a written appraisal demand is on the table.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">02</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Houses, condos and rentals from Lake County bungalows to Evansville brick two-stories.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial-building.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">03</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Retail, office, warehouse, church and association claims with multiple buildings and roofs.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/hail-roof-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="663" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">04</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Hail bruising, granule loss, soft metals and discontinued shingles after central Indiana storms.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/tornado-wind-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">05</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Tornado &amp; Wind Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Tornadoes, derechos and straight-line winds that peel roofs, siding and outbuildings.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="768" height="512" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">06</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Water Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Burst pipes, appliance leaks, sump failures and wind-driven rain inside the home.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">07</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Structure fires, smoke and soot migration, and the contents inventories that follow.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-freeze-snow-load-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">08</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Ice Dam, Freeze &amp; Snow-Load Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Lake-effect snow loads, ice dams, frozen pipes and ice-storm limbs across northern and southern Indiana.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/farm-outbuilding-claim-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/farm-barn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/farm-barn.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">09</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Farm &amp; Outbuilding Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Pole barns, machine sheds, grain bins and farm dwellings across rural Indiana.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">10</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><span class="card-p">A line-by-line read of the carrier’s estimate before you decide whether to invoke appraisal.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/appraisal-umpire-services/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/documents-review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/documents-review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/documents-review.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-no">11</span></span><span class="card-b"><h2>Appraisal Umpire Services</h2><span class="card-p">Neutral umpire for Indiana appraisal panels that need a tie-breaker.</span><span class="card-more">View service <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/indiana-claim-appraisal/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and commercial claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: farms, pole barns, retail, office, industrial, churches, apartments and HOA properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it only hail?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. We value wind, tornado, water, ice dam, snow-load, fire and other covered losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="checker thin" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Is the carrier’s number short?</h2><p>Send us the estimate. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
